=== AC1 — increment is per popup SESSION, not per click ===
open (Notion Attempts = 3)
  click "Update in Notion" #1 → Notion 4, field 4, sent {incrementAttempts:true}
  click "Update in Notion" #2 → Notion 4, field 4, sent {incrementAttempts:false}
reopen popup (new session, Notion 4)
  field on open  → 4  (seeded from Notion, not from a local counter)
  click "Update in Notion" → Notion 5, field 5
PASS — two updates in one session = +1; reopen + update = +1 more.

=== AC3 — first-time save writes Attempts = 1 ===
open ?new=1 (problem not in Notion)
  attempts control hidden, button reads "Save to Notion"
  click save → Notion 1, control revealed, field 1,
               sent {existingPageId:null, attempts:undefined, incrementAttempts:false}
  click save again (same session) → Notion still 1
PASS — create writes 1 and the session flag is armed by the first save.

