=== Known edge (non-blocking, disclosed by the Builder) ===
stage 100 → click "Revisit (Reset)" → Notion becomes 79 (78+1, ignores the staged
100) while the field keeps showing 100 → "Update in Notion" → Notion 100.
The number moves twice and Revisit's own +1 is discarded. No data loss; the user's
explicit staged value wins, which is the documented priority. Recorded, not bounced.
